    "caption": "Total Per-Capita Output Value by Commodity Group, shown to answer analyze the commodity sector composition of total agricultural output value across regions. The Food and Agriculture Organization (FAO) Statistics Division compiled country-level agricultural producer prices deflated by consumer price indices alongside gross per-capita agricultural output from 2005 to 2023. The dataset evaluates terms of trade shocks, commodity-specific volatility, and structural agricultural output differences across global income classifications.",
